  <content>
  <section><title>Activity</title>
<para>Here are the four systems of equations you saw in the previous exercise. Solve each system. Then, check your solutions by substituting them into the original equations to see if the equations are true.
</para>

<para>Use this system of equations to answer 1 - 3.</para>
<blockquote>
  <para>\( \begin{cases} x+2y=8 \\ x=-5 \end{cases} \)</para>
</blockquote>
<div class="os-raise-ib-pset" data-button-text="Check" data-content-id="ba80c1ba-0ac7-469d-ab47-178b7aa014e9" data-fire-learning-opportunity-event="eventnameY" data-fire-success-event="eventnameX" data-retry-limit="0" data-schema-version="1.0">
  <!--Q1-->
  <exercise data-content-id="33e05120-8501-4662-a3b6-de1b951fed45" data-problem-comparator="integer" data-problem-type="input" data-solution="-5">
    <problem>
      <para>What is the \(x\) value?</para>
      <para>Enter your answer here:</para>
    </problem>
    <solution>
      <para>Correct! -5</para>
    </solution>
        </exercise>
  <!--END QUESTION.-->
  <!--Do not edit below line.-->
  <solution>
